  "rationale": "The AI selection and sealed operators previously reused an existing self-hashed economic report without replaying that report from the immutable source database and official target store. A recomputed JSON hash proves internal byte consistency, but it does not prove that the metrics came from the bound source evidence. Both operators now recompute matched economics first and accept an existing restart checkpoint only when the fail-closed artifact writer proves exact equality. The effective source ledger now binds every Round 27 operational entrypoint and its local project import closure. No captured feature row, target, outcome, metric, model, candidate, prompt, threshold, economic rule, or authority was accessed or changed.",
